    "display_name": "Scavenger Hunt",
    "long_instructions": "#Software Scavenger Hunt\r\n\r\nRead the scenarios presented on the canvas. Provide either written text or a screenshot to answer the question asked.",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Use this canvas to document your scavenger hunt through a computer system.",
