            "dragging": false
          },
          {
            "id": "0d5dc2d1-6f26-4741-abd0-2ae3f92d9228",
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
              "text": "1. Pair Up: Work with a partner to complete this scavenger hunt. You can use your own device (laptop, phone, or tablet) or use the computer simulation level.\n\n2. Search and Capture: For each task on the list, search your device or the computer simulation slide deck to find examples of operating systems, application software, or utility software.\n\n3. Document Your Findings:\n\n     - Take a screenshot of where you found the software (if using your device, ensure no personal information is visible).\n     - Answer the question provided for each task in the Activity Guide.\n\n4. Discussion Prep: Be ready to share your findings with the class and explain how the software you found fits its category and role.",
              "strokeColor": "transparent",
              "fontSize": "medium",
              "textAlign": "left",
              "locked": true
            },
            "position": {
              "x": -4428.782073192224,
              "y": -726.9062468941146
            },
            "width": 737.3492506109637,
