          {
            "id": "c22b9754-db1b-417e-8960-e7097f9e04a6",
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
              "text": "Scenario: You’re a help desk technician assisting someone whose device isn’t working properly. Your first step is to find out which operating system their device is running.\n\nDo this: Find where your device shows the name of its operating system.\n\nQuestion: What does this operating system allow your device to do?",
