          {
            "id": "17353e51-622f-4571-98ba-1d7190fce7a9",
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
              "text": "Scenario: You’re a cybersecurity specialist setting up a new device for a client. You need to adjust the system settings to connect to Wi-Fi securely and set up privacy controls.\n\nDo This: Open the settings menu and explore the options for network and privacy settings.\n\nQuestion: What are two examples of tasks you can manage in this menu, and how do they help protect the user?\n",
