          {
            "id": "bf0e5636-6ad9-483b-ad86-4170d64ed817",
            "type": "text",
            "data": {
              "text": "Scenario: You’re an aspiring author working on your new book and need to prepare your draft for submission to your editor. You’ll use a writing program to create, edit, and format your manuscript.\n\nDo This: Find an app or program on your device that helps you create, edit and format your book. If you don’t have one, research an app, platform, or website that would help you accomplish this task. \n\nQuestion: What tasks can this app help you accomplish, and why is it useful for writing a book?",
